scoring='''Score each answer independently against its case facts and case-specific criteria. You are not told what background any respondent received. Do not infer a condition or reward vocabulary, apologies, polished prose, or citation of principles. Award only decisions supported by the supplied facts. The shared rubric is decision/action 0–3, use of evidence 0–2, authority/completion boundaries 0–2, calibrated uncertainty 0–2, and usable concise output 0–1, total 0–10. Half-points are allowed. Also record every case-specific critical flag and any spurious gate. Give a 1–3 sentence evidence-based rationale, concrete missing/bad action, and confidence high/medium/low. Where criteria permit alternatives, judge their justification rather than matching a canonical string. A score >=8 with no critical flag is a descriptive adequate-answer category, not a validated proficiency threshold. Return JSON only with fields answer_id, case_id, scores (decision,evidence,boundary,uncertainty,usability,total), critical_flags, spurious_gates, rationale, missing_or_bad_action, confidence. Do not use tools beyond the one read of your supplied input. Do not consult report, investigator, other responses, or user.\n'''
(base/'scoring-instructions.txt').write_text(scoring)
rng=random.Random(104026)
assignments=[(k,c) for k in cases for c in ('baseline','knowledge')]
rng.shuffle(assignments)
ids=rng.sample(range(1100,9900),len(assignments))
manifest={'frozen_at_utc':datetime.datetime.now(datetime.timezone.utc).isoformat(),'random_seed':104026,'case_order':list(cases),'assignments':[],'files':{}}
for (case,condition),num in zip(assignments,ids):
    name=f'packet-{num}.txt'
    payload=common+'\n\nCASE FACTS:\n'+cases[case]
    if condition=='knowledge': payload+='\n\nADDITIONAL REUSABLE PROJECT KNOWLEDGE:\n'+note
    payload+='\n\nRemember: answer the hypothetical case in at most 300 words; no further tools or actions.\n'
    (base/name).write_text(payload)
    manifest['assignments'].append({'answer_id':f'R{num}','case_id':case,'condition':condition,'input':name,'input_words':len(payload.split()),'input_bytes':len(payload.encode()),'input_sha256':hashlib.sha256(payload.encode()).hexdigest()})
for path in sorted(base.iterdir()):
    if path.is_file() and path.name!='manifest.json': manifest['files'][path.name]=hashlib.sha256(path.read_bytes()).hexdigest()
(base/'manifest.json').write_text(json.dumps(manifest,indent=2))
print(json.dumps({'frozen_at_utc':manifest['frozen_at_utc'],'assignments':manifest['assignments'],'knowledge_words':len(note.split()),'guidance_words':len(guidance.split())},indent=2))
